  "rationale": "The core trait columns (industry_sector, company_type, geo_cluster) directly serve the query by giving real axes to correlate company traits with region, making the set analytically useful overall. Groundedness is moderate: extractions from descriptions are mostly sound, but there are notable errors—Accel mislabeled as 'Other Technology'/Private when clearly a VC, 280 Group as EdTech, and Peninsula/Sand Hill addresses assigned to 'South Bay'—indicating some values not supported by the source. tech_focus_level is weakly warranted and description_length adds little, dragging the holistic scores down modestly."
